# Anchored with a leading slash: this is the generated-images folder at the project
# root only. Unanchored, `output/` matches at EVERY depth, which silently swallowed
# client/src/nodes/output/ -- the shared core of the three output nodes -- so a fresh
# clone could not build the canvas at all.
